{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensembles\/cloudfilesystemsetup\/setlocalstoredirectory(_:discardingexistingcache:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setLocalStoreDirectory","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"path","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardingExistingCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The event store’s directory, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" when no store is available.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"path"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":", any cache already present for this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory must be deleted rather than loaded, and the backend must behave as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though it had never cached anything. The ensemble passes ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" whenever the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store is being rebuilt, so a device starting over is guaranteed a full fetch","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than a delta against a cursor from a previous incarnation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"discardingExistingCache"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CustomCloudBackends"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backends that cache remote state between launches should store that cache inside","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this directory. Doing so ties the cache’s lifetime to the event store’s: when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store is removed or rebuilt, the stale cache goes with it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Caching remote state anywhere with an independent lifetime (the system caches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory, for instance) is unsafe. Such a cache can outlive the event store it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"describes — surviving even app deletion — and a backend that then resumes an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"incremental fetch against a rebuilt cloud may never be told about files that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"predate its stale cursor. The device sees a partial cloud and reports no error.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Called before priming, whenever the ensemble knows its event store. It is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"called for ensemble-independent operations such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble\/retrieveEnsembleIdentifiers(from:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", so implementations must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tolerate priming without it and simply forgo persistent caching in that case.","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:9Ensembles20CloudFileSystemSetupP22setLocalStoreDirectory_23discardingExistingCacheySSSg_SbtF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setLocalStoreDirectory","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discardingExistingCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Ensembles"}],"title":"setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)","required":true,"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup\/setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tells the file system which local directory belongs to the event store it is serving."}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","defaultImplementationsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup\/setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)-1faby"],"title":"CloudFileSystemSetup Implementations","anchor":"CloudFileSystemSetup-Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CloudFileSystemSetup":{"title":"CloudFileSystemSetup","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CloudFileSystemSetup","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/cloudfilesystemsetup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional setup and maintenance operations for cloud file systems."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CloudFileSystemSetup","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CloudFileSystemSetup","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CloudFileSystemSetup/setLocalStoreDirectory(_:discardingExistingCache:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"T